  "description": "FastEasyStringExtensions is a clean, fast, and easy-to-use C# library providing a rich collection of extension methods for strings. Whether you’re building web apps, APIs, or desktop tools, these helpers make working with text simpler, faster, and more expressive.\n\t\t\tIt addresses common string manipulation needs such as encoding, formatting, hashing, counting, and comparison, while keeping your code much more readable by enabling fluent syntax and free of boilerplate.",
